# Credentials for the serverless email handlers in api/.
# Copy to .env.local (git-ignored) and fill in real values.
#
# Both api/contact.js and api/service-request.js send mail through nodemailer's
# Gmail transport, so they need a Google account plus an App Password
# (https://myaccount.google.com/apppasswords) — a normal account password will
# not work with SMTP.
#
# NOTE: these were never set in the standalone abc_brilliant_brains repo (its
# .env only held an unused RESEND_API_KEY), so both forms have been failing.
# They will keep failing until these two vars are populated in the host's
# environment settings.

GMAIL_USER=
GMAIL_APP_PASSWORD=
